  "details": "While working on our newest world, wispy & i noticed that the pictures taken on the 2022 beta are significantly duller.\n\n2019: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1007935858265030709/1147405736066945085/VRChat_2023-09-02_15-40-12.836_1920x1080.png\n\n2022:\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1007935858265030709/1147405736612216852/VRChat_2023-09-02_14-59-52.101_1920x1080.png\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Go to a world that makes heavy use of Post Processing\n\n2. Take a picture",
